-- Performance fix: cover every FK column that lacked a supporting index
-- (advisor-flagged unindexed_foreign_keys). Most of these are tenant_id /
-- *_by / *_id columns that are also the primary join/filter keys hit by
-- RLS policies and reporting views, so this directly reduces per-row
-- lookup cost on every tenant-scoped query and delete-cascade check.

